🎨 AI Virtual Painter

AI Virtual Painter is a real-time, touch-free digital painting application built using Python, OpenCV, MediaPipe, and NumPy. It uses webcam-based hand tracking to recognize gestures and perform different painting actions.

✨ Features
☝️ Draw using your index finger
☝️🖕 Select colors using index + middle fingers
✋ Erase using an open hand
🤏 Capture screenshots using a pinch gesture
🎨 Multiple color options
🖐️ Real-time hand tracking
🖥️ Touch-free interaction through a webcam
🛠️ Technologies Used
Python
OpenCV
MediaPipe
NumPy
📥 Installation

Install the required Python libraries:

pip install opencv-python mediapipe numpy

Download the MediaPipe Hand Landmarker model and place hand_landmarker.task inside the models folder.

▶️ How to Run

Run the application using:

python main.py

Allow webcam access when prompted. The application will open the virtual painting interface.

🖐️ Gesture Controls
Gesture	Action
☝️ Index finger	Draw
☝️🖕 Index + middle fingers	Select color
✋ Open hand	Erase
🤏 Thumb + index pinch	Screenshot
✊ Fist	No special action
🎨 Drawing

Raise only your index finger and move it around the screen to draw on the virtual canvas.

🌈 Color Selection

Raise your index and middle fingers and move them over a color in the toolbar. Hold briefly to select the desired color.

🧹 Erasing

Open your hand with your fingers extended to activate the eraser and remove painted areas.

📸 Screenshot

Use the thumb and index finger pinch gesture to select an area. Move while maintaining the pinch and release to save the selected region.

