🧠 How It Works

The webcam captures live video, while MediaPipe detects hand landmarks. The application analyzes these landmarks to recognize specific gestures and converts them into drawing, erasing, color-selection, and screenshot actions.

Webcam
   ↓
OpenCV
   ↓
MediaPipe Hand Tracking
   ↓
Gesture Recognition
   ↓
Virtual Painting Actions
